[163.76,"o","pass\r\nsandbox-guard: this command line joins separate commands with `&&`, `||`, or `;`. One command per call is easier for the owner to read and to debug, so split it into separate calls next time. Give a directory through the tool's own flag (`git -C`, `jj -R`) rather than `cd … &&` (cargo is the exception: `cd <dir> && cargo …` is fine, because cargo reads its configuration from the current directory).\r\n"]
